repository-code: https://github.com/maRce10/feeding-behavior-covariates-harvestmen
url: https://marce10.github.io/feeding-behavior-covariates-harvestmen/
abstract: >-
  Data, code and analysis reports for Bayesian mixed models of substrate use and
  defensive behavior in Prionostemma sp. 1 harvestmen (Opiliones) with different
  leg conditions exposed to an aversive stimulus paired with one substrate and a
  rewarding stimulus (food) on another.
